  "description": "Supporting Client Library\n        1.0.0 Initial Release\n        1.0.1 Bugfix\n        1.0.3 Added in the parent block edit functionality.\n        1.0.4 Resolved a bug with the settings not working.\n        1.0.5 Resolved some z index bugs.\n        1.0.6 Added in the ability to add on parent blocks.\n        1.1.0 Added the show layers feature and stabilized the block movement.\n        1.1.1 Resolved a movment issue with sibling areas.\n        1.1.2 Resolved issue with the block list\n        1.2.0 Switched to using data types instead of property editors directly.\n        2.0.0 Switched to using Element Document Types for Blocks\n        17.0.2 Updated to be compatible with Umbraco 17\n        17.1.0 Added support for saving layouts\n        17.1.2 Bugfixes for the layouts and a few enhancements.",
